repository-code: "https://github.com/YanboHuang23/M2R-Gillespie-algorithm-for-stochastic-biochemical-systems"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of Gillespie's direct-method stochastic simulation
  algorithm (SSA), applied to degradation, birth-death, protein complex
  formation, ligand-mediated dimerisation and gene expression networks, and
  benchmarked against analytical solutions and deterministic rate equations.
  Second-year group research project (M2R), Department of Mathematics,
  Imperial College London, supervised by Barbara Bravi.
keywords:
  - Gillespie algorithm
  - stochastic simulation algorithm
  - chemical master equation
  - systems biology
